  "summary": "Malicious code in robocatenligne (npm)",
  "details": "The package robocatenligne@1.0.1 is casino malvertising published to the npm registry. It contains no functional code (index.js exports an empty object) and only ships a README.md with French-language promotional content for \"RoboCat Casino\" at robocatenligne[.]com. The package has no lifecycle hooks, no dependencies, and no executable payload — it exists solely to promote a gambling website through npm search results.",
